---
import ImageWrapper from "$lib/components/ImageWrapper.astro";
import Layout from "$layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import oops from "../../public/oops.jpg";
---

{/* @ts-ignore: description not needed for a 404 page lol */}
<Layout
  title="Page not found"
  class="[--global-bg:#003eff] selection:bg-white selection:text-blue-500"
>
  <div class="font-kuro-mono text-base p-4 sm:p-8 space-y-4 font-semibold">
    <p>
      A problem has been detected and has crashed because... idk what are you
      doing here?
    </p>

    <p>PAGE_NOT_FOUND</p>

    <p>If you keep finding 404'ing yourself:</p>
    <div>
      <p>
        - If the URL isn't misspelled or you're delibrately misspelling URLs on
        purpose (because that's what I'd do lol)
      </p>
      <p>
        - You're mis-remembering things and go check the sitemap for this site
      </p>
      <p>- Try searching for something</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
